  "helpRainMmQ": "What are mm of rain?",
  "helpRainMmA": "It's how much water falls. 1 mm is like a layer of water 1 millimeter deep over your field. 40 mm in one day is already heavy rain: better not to fertilize or spray that day.",
  "helpRainMmK": "mm,millimeter,how much rain",
  "helpMoistureQ": "How do I know if my soil is wet?",
